  "body": "**[Original report](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/issues/33) by Johan Thor (Bitbucket: [Johan Thor](https://bitbucket.org/Johan Thor), ).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nIn the options file of ART, there’s the option to set a directory for storing the presets/profiles. By default it points to $HOME/.config/ART/profiles, but when I try to edit it to point in another direction \\(I use ART from two different computers, and want to store the profiles in a Dropbox-directory for syncing…\\) it still reads only the default path.\n",
